---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = '30 June 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="TransferHub disclaimer — aggregated content, no guarantee of accuracy, not professional or betting advice, and no affiliation with clubs or leagues."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl prose prose-gray prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-p:text-gray-600 prose-li:text-gray-600 prose-a:text-emerald-600 prose-h1:font-black prose-h2:font-bold prose-h2:text-lg">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-cream-dim text-sm not-prose">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <h2>Aggregated content</h2>
    <p>TransferHub aggregates publicly available football news headlines and excerpts from third-party publishers and links to the original sources. We do not author the underlying articles and are not responsible for their content or accuracy.</p>

    <h2>No guarantee of accuracy</h2>
    <p>Transfer news and rumours change rapidly and are frequently speculative. Our reliability ratings are automated estimates generated by rule-based logic, not editorial verification. We make no warranty that any information is accurate, complete, or current.</p>

    <h2>Not professional or betting advice</h2>
    <p>Nothing on this Site constitutes financial, legal, or betting advice. Do not make betting, financial, or other decisions based on content here. If you choose to gamble, do so responsibly and within the law of your jurisdiction.</p>

    <h2>No affiliation</h2>
    <p>TransferHub is an independent aggregator. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any football club, league, governing body, or news publisher. Club names and marks are used for identification only.</p>

    <h2>External links &amp; ads</h2>
    <p>We link to external sites and display third-party advertising. We do not control and are not responsible for external content or advertised products and services.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions or takedown requests: <a href="mailto:hello@transferhub.net">hello@transferhub.net</a>. See also our <a href="/attribution">Attribution Policy</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
